// Country flag skins (developer only for now - the Shop's Skins tab): each flag is drawn here on a canvas,
// so nothing is downloaded and nothing but the flag's id goes over the network. The scamper is a tall
// block, so a flag hangs vertically, like a banner: the flag's top edge runs down the left side. Emblems
// (stars, the maple leaf, suns, discs) are turned back upright. Simplified where the real one has a
// detailed coat of arms.
// FLAGS: [{ id, name, draw(d) }] - d draws in the flag's own landscape coordinates, 300 x 200 (3:2; a flag
// with other proportions is stretched to it, like on a phone keyboard)
